OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with GBH in connection
OL,4,Awith man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith an investigation into the death of
OL,8,Fa man in Barnsley.
OL,10,FRussell Baxter, 41, was found injured
OL,11,Fat a property on Wingfield Road on 3
OL,12,FSeptember and died at the scene. A
OL,13,Fpost-mortem examination into his death
OL,14,Fhad proved "inconclusive", according to
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Police.
OL,17,FPhilip Benson, 57, of Wingfield Road,
OL,18,FAthersley South, had been charged with
OL,19,FSection 18 grievous bodily harm with
OL,20,Fintent and with perverting the course
OL,21,Fof justice in connection with Baxter's
OL,22,Fdeath, a force spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
