OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with GBH in connection
OL,4,Awith man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBenson appeared before Doncaster
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Friday and was
OL,8,Fremanded in custody ahead of his next
OL,9,Fappearance at Sheffield Crown Court on
OL,10,F9 October.
